// WCS - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

// WCS: a World Coordinate System is not a file format of its own.
// It is a set of FITS header keywords -- CTYPE1, CTYPE2, CRVAL1 --
// and a `.wcs` file is a FITS header carrying them.
//
// Eight cards, eighty bytes each. Every card puts '=' in column 9
// and its value right-justified so it ends in column 30, and the
// header ends with END. COMMENT is the one card kind with no '=' at
// all, which is why `Hello World!` goes in one of those.
//
// wcs: 640 bytes, dumped sixteen at a time.
//
// The bytes below are not hand-written. They are built from the
// format's own field widths by scripts/build_object_formats.py, and
// scripts/verify_encodings.py reads the fields back by name -- the
// magic number, the lengths, the offsets. A hex dump written from
// memory is wrong in one byte and looks exactly like a correct one.
//

// 53 49 4D 50 4C 45 20 20 3D 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |SIMPLE  =       |   <- 0000
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 54 20 20 |             T  |   <- 0010
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 0020
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 0030
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 0040
// 42 49 54 50 49 58 20 20 3D 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |BITPIX  =       |   <- 0050
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 38 20 20 |             8  |   <- 0060
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 0070
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 0080
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 0090
// 4E 41 58 49 53 20 20 20 3D 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |NAXIS   =       |   <- 00A0
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 32 20 20 |             2  |   <- 00B0
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 00C0
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 00D0
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 00E0
// 57 43 53 41 58 45 53 20 3D 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |WCSAXES =       |   <- 00F0
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 32 20 20 |             2  |   <- 0100
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 0110
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 0120
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 0130
// 43 54 59 50 45 31 20 20 3D 20 27 52 41 2D 2D 2D |CTYPE1  = 'RA---|   <- 0140
// 54 41 4E 27 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |TAN'            |   <- 0150
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 0160
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 0170
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 0180
// 43 54 59 50 45 32 20 20 3D 20 27 44 45 43 2D 2D |CTYPE2  = 'DEC--|   <- 0190
// 54 41 4E 27 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |TAN'            |   <- 01A0
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 01B0
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 01C0
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 01D0
// 43 4F 4D 4D 45 4E 54 20 20 20 48 65 6C 6C 6F 20 |COMMENT   Hello |   <- 01E0
// 57 6F 72 6C 64 21 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |World!          |   <- 01F0
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 0200
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 0210
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 0220
// 45 4E 44 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |END             |   <- 0230
// 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 20 |                |   <- 0240
